"""DGP5 second freeze + manifests (derived from dgp4_manifests.py). `freeze` writes FREEZE.json (implementation, configuration, runner / analyzer / oracle identities, native build + dependency identities; the EVAL5 / ORACLE5 fresh inputs NOT yet generated);
`holdout` (run at the frozen commit from a clean detached checkout) VERIFIES the 52 DGP4 main inputs (now all exposed), the 24 oracle inputs, the preservation inputs, GENERATES the 8 fresh EVAL5 and 4 fresh ORACLE5 models, hash-binds everything, and writes MODEL_MANIFEST.json (every input with its
exposure label), the per-panel manifests consumed by run_dgp5.py / the oracle driver, and DIAG_MANIFEST.json (the eight predetermined diagnostic models). usage: dgp5_manifests.py freeze|holdout [--code-root ROOT]"""

